{"id":"vod_sn_37694","vodId":"37694","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"新网球王子","name_cn":"新网球王子","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/596e486929b39698f2a94fd3718c59fe.jpg"},"summary":"全国大赛完结以后，越前龙马（皆川纯子 配音）回到了美国，但因为一封从日本来的信让龙马速速回来。原来日本U—17高中生网球集训首次在初中生当中选拔。而在全国大赛表现十分优异的青春、冰帝、不动峰等学园的优秀选手都获得了这项集训的资格。赶上了末班车的龙马有了更加广阔的展示空间，从初中生跨越到高中生，龙马等一行人即将面临的是更强的选手，网球王子们再度归来，华丽更甚，招数也更加令人眼花缭乱……　　本剧改编自许斐刚的同名漫画，剧情紧随着前作的最终章，从全国大赛几个月后的故事开始说起。万众瞩目的王子们再度归来，带着新人物的出场，一场场扣人心弦的比赛即将开始。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7BGDm3jYay1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fDH1wXyZ3w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RVSJynfFg81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X0PxDgz1kM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9mrM0RwZfs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mceGjpXFEt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9EJjDykTCN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dYNcwuRSxb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y8ZFsg0PeD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VjeLcm8inL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WVGkDMrEmS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a4eNdPqbBn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i6xpR1t11c1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:07.921Z"}